  "instance_name": "cultural_ownership",
  "label": "Cultural ownership",
  "description": "The idea that certain cultures or groups have exclusive rights to their cultural expressions, often used in anti-racist discourse to challenge the notion that cultures can be appropriated or borrowed without permission or understanding. The meme implies that white settlers are claiming ownership of other cultures, which is a central point of contention in decolonial theory.",
